{
  "id": "RLSA-2026:69541",
  "title": "Important: rsyslog security update",
  "issued": {
    "date": "2026-09-23 18:07:43"
  },
  "updated": {
    "date": "2026-09-24 12:14:08"
  },
  "severity": "Important",
  "description": "The rsyslog packages provide an enhanced, multi-threaded syslog daemon. It supports MySQL, syslog/TCP, RFC 3195, permitted sender lists, filtering on any message part, and fine-grained control over output format.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* rsyslog: rsyslog: Denial of service via heap buffer overflow in RainerScript replace() function (CVE-2026-78002)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
